  "body": "## Summary\n\nInstalls Sepo agent infrastructure into `CodeShaping/annotate-edit`.\n\nInstalled files:\n- Added `.agent/` from `self-evolving/repo` release `v0.3.0`, excluding generated `.agent/dist/` and `.agent/node_modules/`.\n- Added Sepo-owned `.github/` issue templates, actions, prompts, and workflows.\n- Updated `.gitignore` to ignore regenerated Sepo bundle and dependency directories.\n\nPreserved/skipped files:\n- Target repository had no existing `.github/` files, so no same-path target-owned GitHub files were overwritten.\n- Preserved existing `.gitignore` entries and appended Sepo ignores idempotently.\n- Did not add optional `.skills/` files or root `AGENT.md`; none were requested.\n- Did not add `agent/memory` or `agent/rubrics`; initialize them after merge if wanted.\n\n\n## Required setup after merge\n\n1. [Install the Sepo GitHub App on the target repository](https://github.com/apps/sepo-agent-app/installations/select_target), or choose another supported auth path from the [setup guide](https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/blob/main/.agent/docs/setup/setup-guide.md).\n2. Add `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`, and/or `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` in [Actions secrets](https://github.com/CodeShaping/annotate-edit/settings/secrets/actions).\n3. Run [Agent / Onboarding / Check Setup](https://github.com/CodeShaping/annotate-edit/actions/workflows/agent-onboarding.yml).\n4. Review the [Sepo setup check issue](https://github.com/CodeShaping/annotate-edit/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20%22Sepo%20setup%20check%22) and complete remaining setup.\n5. If needed, run [Agent / Memory / Initialization](https://github.com/CodeShaping/annotate-edit/actions/workflows/agent-memory-bootstrap.yml) to create `agent/memory`.\n6. Optionally run [Agent / Rubrics / Initialization](https://github.com/CodeShaping/annotate-edit/actions/workflows/agent-rubrics-initialization.yml) to create `agent/rubrics`.\n\n## Source revision\n\n- Source repository: `self-evolving/repo`\n- Selected ref: `v0.3.0`\n- Commit SHA: `bec597687fdb1a1786e7127ee6ddd5ec088f36af`\n- Release: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/releases/tag/v0.3.0\n- Selection reason: latest non-draft stable release; no prerelease fallback was needed.\n\n## Validation details\n\n- Resolved install target with `resolve-install-target.js`: `CodeShaping/annotate-edit`.\n- Prepared fork worktree with `install-fork-pr.js prepare`: `sepo-agent/annotate-edit`, branch `agent/install-agent-infra`.\n- Audited `.github/` same-path files before copying; target had no `.github/` tree.\n- Verified `.agent/dist/` and `.agent/node_modules/` were not copied.\n- Reviewed and committed install diff: `292 files changed, 51333 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)`.\n- Commit: `bca3bed chore: install Sepo agent infrastructure`.\n- Working tree was clean after commit.\n\nSkipped checks:\n- Did not run target application tests or Sepo runtime checks before merge; this PR only copies install infrastructure and setup is completed after merge through the onboarding workflow.\n\nSource install request: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/issues/360\n<!-- sepo-install-source-request: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/issues/360 -->\n",
